OL,3,GNEWSAWhich Anglian Water areas are
OL,4,Aworst for pollution?
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnglian Water has been accused of "not
OL,7,Ftaking polluting seriously" after it
OL,8,Fregistered 12 serious incidents in 2025
OL,9,Fand was rated "requires improvement" by
OL,10,Fregulators for the fifth year in a row.
OL,12,FThe company, which supplies water and
OL,13,Fsewerage services across the East of
OL,14,FEngland, parts of the East Midlands and
OL,15,FLincolnshire, admitted it had "more to
OL,16,Fdo", but said bathing waters in its
OL,17,Farea were their cleanest in a decade.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
