OL,3,GNEWSAWhich Anglian Water areas are
OL,4,Aworst for pollution?
OL,5,
OL,6,FScientists and campaigners said they
OL,7,Fwere still seeing high levels of
OL,8,Fpollution in the region's waterways,
OL,9,Ffrom the River Great Ouse in
OL,10,FBedfordshire to the River Deben in
OL,11,FSuffolk.
OL,13,FThey are calling on Anglian Water `
OL,14,Fwhich reported operating profits of
OL,15,F#636m this year ` to ramp up
OL,16,Finvestment.
